---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Sarkari Sahayak 2026"
  description="Sarkari Sahayak ki Terms of Service — usage terms, accuracy disclaimer, simulation info, acceptable use policy."
  canonical="/terms/"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">

      <div class="section-head center-head">
        <p class="section-label">Terms</p>
        <h1 class="section-title">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="section-sub">Sarkari Sahayak use karne ke liye ye terms padhein</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <p>
          Sarkari Sahayak (<strong>govtjob.salarypitcher.com</strong>) ko use karke aap ye terms accept karte hain. Agar aap in terms se sahmat nahi hain, toh kripya website ka use na karein.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">Informational Use Only</h2>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Sarkari Sahayak ek <strong>sirf informational platform</strong> hai — yeh kisi government process ka official part nahi hai</li>
          <li>Yahan di gayi jaankari aapko guide karne ke liye hai — actual application ya process aapko <strong>official government website</strong> pe karna hoga</li>
          <li>Hum <strong>kisi bhi government service ko handle, process, ya process nahi karte</strong></li>
          <li>Humari jaankari aapko "as-is" di jaati hai — hum kisi bhi guarantee ya warranty ke saath nahi dete</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">Accuracy of Information</h2>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Hum har jaankari ko <strong>official government websites se verify</strong> karke publish karte hain</li>
          <li>Par <strong>sarkari websites pe changes</strong> kabhi bhi ho sakte hain — humari team rose update karti hai, par kabhi-kabhi delay ho sakta hai</li>
          <li>Agar aapko koi <strong>galat ya outdated jaankari</strong> dikhe, toh humse contact karein — hum jaldi correct karenge</li>
          <li>Hum <strong>100% accuracy ki guarantee nahi dete</strong> — hamesha official website se verify karein</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">Simulations &amp; Demos</h2>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Sarkari Sahayak pe kuch <strong>simulation ya demo content</strong> hota hai — jaise marksheet simulation, result preview, ya fee calculator</li>
          <li>Ye sab <strong>sirf educational purpose</strong> ke liye hain — real data nahi hain</li>
          <li>Humara koi bhi simulation <strong>official document nahi hai</strong> — isko real proof ya document ke roop mein use na karein</li>
          <li>RBSE marksheet simulation ya kisi bhi board ka result preview — ye sab <strong>demo hai, official result nahi</strong></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">Intellectual Property</h2>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Sarkari Sahayak ka <strong>content, design, aur code</strong> — sab humara apna hai</li>
          <li>Aap is content ko <strong>personal use</strong> ke liye padh sakte hain</li>
          <li>Par <strong>copy, reproduce, ya distribute</strong> karna allowed nahi hai bina humari permission ke</li>
          <li>Government logos ya official symbols jo dikhaye gaye hain — wo sirf <strong>identification ke liye</strong> hain, unka use kisi bhi tarah se misleading nahi hona chahiye</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">Acceptable Use</h2>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Website ka use <strong>sirf lawful purposes</strong> ke liye hona chahiye</li>
          <li><strong>Spam, phishing, ya misleading activity</strong> ke liye website ka use na karein</li>
          <li>Website ko <strong>harm ya disrupt</strong> karne ki koshish na karein — jaise DDoS, scraping, ya unauthorized access</li>
          <li>Agar aap <strong>automation ya bots</strong> se content scrape karte hain, toh woh allowed nahi hai</li>
          <li>Government impersonation ya <strong>faking official identity</strong> ke liye website ka use na karein</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">Limitation of Liability</h2>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Sarkari Sahayak <strong>kisi bhi loss, damage, ya inconvenience</strong> ke liye responsible nahi hai jo website use karne se ho</li>
          <li>Hum <strong>third-party websites</strong> ki content ya privacy ke liye responsible nahi hain</li>
          <li>Humari website pe di gayi jaankari <strong>"as-is"</strong> hai — hum kisi bhi guarantee ke saath nahi dete</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">Changes to Terms</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          Hum in terms mein kabhi bhi change kar sakte hain. Agar major change hua toh hum is page ko update kar denge. Website continue karne se aap updated terms accept karte hain.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl); text-align:center">
        <p>
          Koi sawaal hai? <a href="/contact" class="mini-link">Humse contact karein</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
